@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = replace-with-your-secret
@leadId = 123456
@fopId = test
@webhookSecret = replace-with-KOMMO_WEBHOOK_TOKEN-from-env

### Kommo URL-only webhook: headers and body are unnecessary
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/kommo/prepayment?key={{webhookSecret}}&leadId={{leadId}}

### Full payment on another lead
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/kommo/full?key={{webhookSecret}}&leadId={{leadId}}

### Postpayment for the lead with an existing advance
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/kommo/postpayment?key={{webhookSecret}}&leadId={{leadId}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Automatic FOP selection from field 2110073 (requires configured mappings)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/leads/{{leadId}}/receipts/prepayment
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Full payment (use a separate lead from the advance/postpayment scenario)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/leads/{{leadId}}/receipts/full
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fopId":"{{fopId}}"}

### Prepayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/leads/{{leadId}}/receipts/prepayment
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fopId":"{{fopId}}"}

### Postpayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/leads/{{leadId}}/receipts/postpayment
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fopId":"{{fopId}}"}

### Read operation returned by any create endpoint
@operationId = replace-with-operationId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operations/{{operationId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Resume the same operation after an upstream failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operations/{{operationId}}/retry
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
